132
00:13:06,118 --> 00:13:10,623
At 7 a.m., he went on a short walk and then had breakfast from 8 to 930.

133
00:13:10,623 --> 00:13:14,502
He had his first work session in his study, and this was his most creative block.

134
00:13:14,502 --> 00:13:18,672
From 930 to 1030 he had a break to read letters and spend time with family.

135
00:13:18,672 --> 00:13:25,346
Then from 1030 to noon he had his second work session, and by this point Darwin considered himself to have done a good day's work.

136
00:13:25,346 --> 00:13:33,479
Then afternoon he had a second walk of the day around the sand walk, which is a famous quarter mile gravel path that he built specifically for thinking and reflection.

137
00:13:33,479 --> 00:13:34,939
I really want to do that one day.

138
00:13:34,939 --> 00:13:37,233
