141
00:13:50,830 --> 00:13:58,587
Then after lunch, Darwin read the newspaper, then rested while his wife read aloud to him. At 4 p.m. he had the third walk of the day, usually around the sand.

142
00:13:58,587 --> 00:14:00,381
Walk again, sometimes with company.

143
00:14:00,381 --> 00:14:10,349
